WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.849 --> 00:00:02.849
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:06.460
We are Pongfinity and welcome to another episode
of 'Challenge Pongfinity'!

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:11.940
This is the series where YOU challenge US
with your craziest ideas related to table

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:12.940
tennis.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.059
We will go through all of your comments in
the comment-section and choose the best and

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:18.850
most creative ideas and use them in our next
video.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.930
So make sure to leave your comments in the
comment-section below and we will give you

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.800
a shout out in the next video.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.680
So Jake Reynolds wants us to play table tennis
over the curtains.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.560
If you mean these curtains, that's going to
be difficult!

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.000
BUT

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.760
Let's do it!

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.520
Caleb Clarkson asks if we can split a table
tennis ball by hitting it at a sharp upright

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:36.590
knife.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:40.000
Thanks for the idea Caleb - we will give it
a try!

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:17.250
Next up AlexArconiteGames wants us to play
a 1 minute rally of only using under the leg

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.920
shots or behind the back shots.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.920
I'll go behind the back, you go between the
legs!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.280
Sure!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.120
Okay, the next suggestion is from GarlanVlo,
and he wants us to rip a piece of paper with

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.760
a ping pong ball.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.680
Well it didn't quite rip but we made a hole!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:32.480
There.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:34.160
Now it's ripped.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.960
Thanks for all your really good ideas, we
had great time filming today's session!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:05.290
Make sure to subscribe to the channel by clicking
here and don't forget to leave your ideas

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.930
in the comment-section below!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.540
Until next time!

